<title>JAPAN: Shinseido -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinseido -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 40.47		vs	   39.34</p>
<p> Operating	    1.40		vs	    1.17</p>
<p> Current	    972    million	  vs	  737    million</p>
<p> Net		  376    million	  vs	  329    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.04 yen	  vs	   12.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  27 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinseido Co Ltd is a top retailer of video software, CDs and music tapes.</p>
